          ("2. Shravasti (Sahet-Mahet)", ["Capital of Kosala kingdom, where Buddha spent 24 monsoon retreats (Vassa), predominantly in the Jetavana monastery gifted by merchant Anathapindika.", "Performed the 'Twin Miracle' (Yamaka Patihariya) to confound non-believers."]),
